### Offer Letter Scanner

Allow PDF and image uploads.

Extract:
- Company
- Recruiter
- Email
- Position
- Salary
- Joining date
- Work location
- Website
- Contact information
- Payment instructions

Check relevant inconsistencies and suspicious claims.

### Email Scanner

Allow pasted email content and supported uploads.

Analyse:
- Sender
- Reply-to
- Domain
- Message
- Links
- Attachments
- Urgency
- Payment requests
- Credential requests

Inspect SPF, DKIM and DMARC only when original headers are available.

### URL Scanner

Analyse:
- URL structure
- Domain
- Threat intelligence
- RDAP information
- DNS
- HTTPS certificate
- Redirects
- Company-domain consistency

Protect against SSRF, private IP access, localhost and unsafe redirects.

### Job Description Scanner

Detect:
- Unrealistic salary
- Guaranteed selection
- Registration fees
- Training fees
- Suspicious work-from-home promises
- Task scams
- Missing employer identity
- Unnecessary sensitive-data requests

### Screenshot and Message Scanner

Allow:
- WhatsApp screenshots
- Telegram screenshots
- Email screenshots
- Recruitment advertisements

Use OCR.

Show extracted text for user correction before analysis.

### Common result page

Display:
- Risk score
- Risk category
- Evidence confidence
- Extracted information
- Security findings
- Positive observations
- Missing information
- Sources
- Recommendations

Actions:
- Save Report
- Download Report
- Rescan
- Report to Community

All actions must work.

